        <briefdescription>
<para>Configure RPU core boot address (TCM if 0, else vector table). </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>RpuCore</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to the target RPU core instance </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>BootAddr</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Boot vector address; 0 selects TCM boot</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Always XST_SUCCESS (no failure path; redundant call site uses XSECURE_REDUNDANT_CALL to detect register-write glitches) </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
